; printobserver — the extrusion print the integration tier charges.
;
; Heats nothing and extrudes along a square, a half-second dwell after every
; move, so a virtual printer streams it for about a minute and its file
; position can be read growing. Absolute extrusion that only ever feeds, so
; OctoPrint's analysed length and the sum of the moves are the same figure.
G21 ; millimetres
G90 ; absolute positioning
M82 ; absolute extrusion
